# QUIRK/DEFECT: reorder_items2 does not validate that the list contains every item. A list that is merely
# different (shorter, or missing items) is applied as given: unlisted items are silently dropped from the scene's
# chain (still alive, but no longer enumerable). Callers must pass a complete list. Only identical layouts return
# false. (An implementation may reject incomplete lists; a faithful port reproduces this result.)
source s 100 100
scene main
add main s a
add main s b
add main s c
reorder2 main c a
order_of main
get_order_pos c
get_order_pos a
echo -- the dropped item b still exists as a handle; its parent link is untouched
print b
